{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function", "label": "ADR 0031 \u2014 The forecast runs inside the Forge function, and the calculator is retired", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 2026-09-01: the same Python under Pyodide inside the function; hosted calculator retired; remotes block leaves; eligible for Runs on Atlassian and PINNED by construction."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_one_implementation_of_every_figure", "label": "One implementation of every figure", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Python moves; nothing is rewritten. Cost: ~10x slower forecast on Forge's CPU, seven-second cold load, one route that no longer fits a synchronous call."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_sequencing_is_asynchronous", "label": "Sequencing is asynchronous", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cubic in ask count (4/8/12/16 asks: 1.1/7/21/48 s native, 10x on Forge); the resolver pushes an event, a consumer computes, the adapter polls and hands the page one {ok, status, body}."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_forecast_is_asynchronous_correction", "label": "Corrected 2026-09-03: the forecast is asynchronous too", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On a sparse 906-observation board forecast_completion walks ~280 days per trial; 12\u201315 s in-function against the adapter's 15 s; facts, history and burndown stay synchronous."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_twelve_ask_cap", "label": "Cap: twelve asks, everywhere", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lives in the tool so both transports refuse at the same number in the same sentence; sixteen fits but is eight minutes of a reader's attention."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_consumer_budget", "label": "Budget: 900 seconds and 1,024 MB", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ceiling rather than need; Forge bills measured time on a run that finishes."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_retry_guard", "label": "Retry guard against a run that cannot finish", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A consumer killed at timeout is re-invoked forty seconds later for a day; on any retry it writes a refusal and returns."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_event_carries_projection", "label": "The event carries the projection", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A consumer cannot read Jira as the viewer; 100 KB event limit refused with a sentence rather than truncated."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_payload_chunks_in_app_storage", "label": "Forecast payload travels through app storage in chunks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A team's whole history exceeds 100 KB; chunks under the 240 KiB row limit written before the push and deleted as read."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_reload_joins_job_in_flight", "label": "A reload joins the job in flight", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jobs keyed by context, dataset content and account; one computation with two collectors, not a cached result."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_job_row", "label": "The job row", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unguessable key, status started/done/refused, timestamp, asking account; poll refuses other accounts so ADR 0018 mirroring holds by comparison; deleted on collection, one-hour TTL by its own timestamp."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_runtime_travels_as_base64", "label": "How the runtime travels", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Forge's bundler rewrites Pyodide's dynamic import; five runtime files and Python sources travel base64 in a generated module unpacked to /tmp."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_memory_snapshot", "label": "Resolver loads from a memory snapshot; the consumer does not", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Snapshot cuts cold start 11 s to 1.3 s but everything after runs 1.65x slower on Forge; right for the resolver, wrong for minutes of computation."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_generated_runtime_module", "label": "Generated at deploy, never committed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "make forge-deploy produces it from pinned pyodide 314.0.6 and the Python in agent/tools/ and service/; a committed copy is a second copy that drifts."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_wasm_parity_suite", "label": "A sixth suite: Pyodide answer equals native byte for byte", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Successor of the hosted service's parity test; the only thing between two runtimes and a drifting figure."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_probe_app_settled_versions", "label": "A throwaway probe app settled version costs by deploying", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Consumer module and function are minor; adding a remote is major; removing a bare remote was minor but this app's realm-bearing remote was major on 2026-09-03."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_routes_move_one_per_commit", "label": "Routes move one per commit; git is the switch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each deploy has one change to blame; a runtime switch that outlives the migration is a second code path nobody tests."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_runs_on_atlassian_badge", "label": "Runs on Atlassian badge earned when the remotes block leaves", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_hard_refusal_at_three_asks", "label": "Rejected: hard refusal at two or three asks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sells a sequencing tile that refuses the case it exists for."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_snapshot_on_consumer", "label": "Rejected: Pyodide's snapshot on the consumer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Slows every second of computation by two thirds on a function that runs for minutes."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_pyodide_in_iframe", "label": "Rejected: Pyodide in the Custom UI iframe", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Needs unsafe-eval (major version), half speed in a hidden tab, and the weekly brief has no browser."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_polling_in_page", "label": "Rejected: polling in the page", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Would teach src/app.js what a job is, a transport detail carried to every reader."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_cached_result", "label": "Rejected: caching a result by board and dataset", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A figure served without saying when it was computed is the quiet wrongness ADR 0017 exists to stop; the seed already makes a recompute identical."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_committing_runtime_module", "label": "Rejected: committing the generated runtime module", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eighteen megabytes in git and a second copy of the Python."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_moving_every_route_at_once", "label": "Rejected: moving every route in one deploy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_first_ask_timing_guard", "label": "Rejected: a first-ask timing estimate as the budget guard", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Priced per ask; the cost is cubic; a count is honest and deterministic."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_rejected_sixteen_asks", "label": "Rejected: sixteen asks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_one_implementation_of_every_figure", "target": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_sequencing_is_asynchronous", "target": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0031-the-forecast-runs-inside-the-forge-function.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function_forecast_is_asynchronous_correction", "target": "docs_adr_0031_the_forecast_runs_inside_the_forge_function", "relation": "ration